  - workflow_states_count (13/13 FSM states present)
  - knowledge_graph_or_list_present (SVG with graph/edges)
  - audit_table_present (Transition History keyword)
  - memory_loaded (Memory Explorer heading)
  - bitemporal_replay_ui_present (Replay/cutoff keyword)
  - arabic_rtl_enabled (dir=rtl after Arabic toggle)
  - mobile_hamburger_visible (hamburger on mobile viewport)
  - no_uncaught_page_errors (0 errors during journey)

Quality gates (all PASS, no regressions):
  - TypeScript typecheck: clean
  - ESLint: 0 errors, 20 warnings (pre-existing, unrelated)
  - Frontend unit/component tests: 23/23 pass
  - Frontend production build: 275KB JS / 80KB gzipped
  - Backend regression: 414 passed, 5 skipped (no change)

